Subject: [PATCH 2/3] =?UTF-8?q?tools:=20register=20Prism=20ternary=20numer?=
 =?UTF-8?q?ic=20formats=20(PQ2=5F0=5FG128/PTQ1=5F0=5FG128)=20=E2=80=94=20t?=
 =?UTF-8?q?he=20released=20patch=20bundle=20omits=20the=20Python=20side?=
